  "description": "<p>Verdant Intimates is a modern lingerie line founded, designed and ethically crafted in New York City. Through a focus on impeccable fit and elevated design, we aim to bridge the gap between function and luxury, powered by the belief that women deserve to feel not only comfortable, but confident throughout every phase of their lives.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The brand was founded in 2023 by Eleanor Mooney and Michelle Bergmann, two veterans of the lingerie industry with over a decade of experience fitting thousands of diverse women. Verdant&rsquo;s approach to intimates prioritizes the use of high quality fabrics that are easy to wear, beautifully designed pieces that provide support even as we age and evolve. Each collection is developed based on customer feedback with an intentional focus on fit.</p>\r\n<p>At its core, Verdant Intimates creates quality pieces that are functional, timeless, effortless, and sophisticated, elevating lingerie essentials while providing support for modern, active lifestyles&mdash;and the women who lead them.</p>",
